      "narration": "Every combination comes out of one recipe, and the recipe is three lines. Current dot append puts a topping on. Call that the choose step. Backtrack calls itself and builds every pizza that starts this way. Call that explore. And current dot pop takes the topping back off. Call that the undo. Choose, explore, undo. Say that out loud a few times, because every backtracking problem you'll ever meet is those three lines wrapped around a different rule.",
      "durationFrames": 833,
